<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 69.8363 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 69.8363 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 69.8363 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange from 69.8358 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				    Oct 11		  Oct 10</p>
<p> tenge per dollar	     69.8363		 69.8358</p>
<p> volume ($ million)		  4.075		   0.380</p>
<p> tenge per mark		 45.9600		 45.8980</p>
<p> volume (DM million)		 0.020		   0.075</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
